# An activation's own unstamped append - made while its view of the fence gate is
# closed - is not counted as reported. Its next live advance passes another
# writer's unstamped append below its own. Moved from the design's mutation of the
# same name.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestNoSelfReport
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an own unstamped append does not raise the activation's reported watermark
PERTURBS: OwnAllocUnstamped
BOUNDS: WithGateFlip = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ lastU' = next
    /\ seenU' = [seenU EXCEPT ![a] = Max2(@, next)]
--- REPLACE
    /\ lastU' = next
\* MUTATION: no self-report.
    /\ seenU' = seenU
--- END
